&lt;div class=&quot;scp-image-block block-right&quot; style=&quot;width:&amp;quot;240px&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/scp-5457/nutcracker&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/scp-5457/nutcracker/medium.jpg&quot; style=&quot;width:&amp;quot;240px&amp;quot;;&quot; alt=&quot;nutcracker&quot; class=&quot;image&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;scp-image-caption&quot; style=&quot;width:&amp;quot;240px&amp;quot;;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-5457 at the time of initial discovery.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Item #:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5457&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Object Class:&lt;/strong&gt; Euclid&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Special Containment Procedures:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5457 is contained in a standard small goods storage room at Site-21K. To check the mental state of the SCP-5457, an interview is held once a week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Description:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5457 is a wooden Nutcracker. SCP-5457 has intelligence and can speak English even though there is no vocal organs. SCP-5457 is be able to move its arms and legs, but not for a long time. SCP-5457 can fire small wooden bullets with a gun attached to its arm. SCP-5457 doesn&#039;t appear to need any nutrition.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-5457 identified itself as a man named █████ living in ███████ state. It has been confirmed that there is actually a person with that identity and has been missing since a few weeks ago.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Addendum 5457.1&lt;/strong&gt; Interview Log&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interview #5457-1&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;lt;Begin Log&amp;gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr. ████:&lt;/strong&gt; So, how are you feeling today?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-5457:&lt;/strong&gt; Fine.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr. ████:&lt;/strong&gt; Okay, then would you tell me how you became this Nutcracker?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-5457:&lt;/strong&gt; I don&#039;t know either. I just fell asleep in my office, but when I woke up, I found myself a nutcracker.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr. ████:&lt;/strong&gt; Is there anything you think is related to this happening?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-5457:&lt;/strong&gt; Nothing. The last time I saw a Nutcracker was when I was growing up at my grandparents&#039; house. Do you know why this happened to me?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr. ████:&lt;/strong&gt; We don&#039;t know anything at all, too. I&#039;m working on a study to get you retrieve.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-5457:&lt;/strong&gt; Damn it..&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr. ████:&lt;/strong&gt; It won&#039;t help much, but cheer up. We will do our best to help you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-5457:&lt;/strong&gt; Thanks. Ah, how about Annie? Is she alright?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr. ████:&lt;/strong&gt; Uhm.. She is fine. But..&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;*a momentary silence*&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr. ████:&lt;/strong&gt; She thinks you&#039;re still missing, so she&#039;s asking for help from SNS.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-5457:&lt;/strong&gt; Missing? What are you talking about Missing?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr. ████:&lt;/strong&gt; It has been known that you have been missing for weeks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-5457:&lt;/strong&gt; That means&amp;#8230; you guys didn&#039;t tell them I just became a nutcracker?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr. ████:&lt;/strong&gt; Yes. We will keep this secret to prevent people from falling into confusion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-5457:&lt;/strong&gt; Okay, I see.. Then, when can I go back home?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr. ████:&lt;/strong&gt; Uh&amp;#8230; I&#039;m sorry, but I won&#039;t let you go back to your home.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-5457:&lt;/strong&gt; What? Why?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr. ████:&lt;/strong&gt; Just like I said. We&#039;re not going to let people know that you&#039;ve become like this.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-5457:&lt;/strong&gt; Why? I would do nothing but talk to my daughter! She has to know this! She will be waiting for me for a long time!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr. ████:&lt;/strong&gt; We have an duty to keep you from being known to the world. I&#039;m sorry, but I can&#039;t help you with that.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-5457:&lt;/strong&gt; No, you can&#039;t! I just want to go back to my daughter!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dr. ████:&lt;/strong&gt; I&#039;m so sorry about that but we can&#039;tー&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SCP-5457:&lt;/strong&gt; Shut up! Just let me go!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;*SCP-5457 shoots the wooden gun that was attached to its arm at Dr.████.*&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;lt;End Log&amp;gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Closing Statement:&lt;/strong&gt; Dr. ████ had a slight injury to his hand. Whether to modify the containment procedure for SCP-5457 is under consideration.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&amp;#32;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&amp;#32;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
