ize of the D that matters, but how you use it.&quot;</em><br /> ~ <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/placeholder-mcd" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6536693&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609014709" alt="Placeholder McD" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6536693)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/placeholder-mcd" >Placeholder McD</a></span></p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <strong><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&gt;</span> Additional Information:</strong> <p>In the event that you must contact JakdragonX, or otherwise require his assistance/wish to collaborate with him, you can message him using any of these methods:</p> <ol> <li>Discord: JakdragonX#0728</li> <li>IRC: &quot;Jak&quot; (Please Note: Depending on location, time, or situation, this name may change. Please adjust accordingly.)</li> <li>Wikidot: <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jakdragonx" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5588260&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609014709" alt="JakdragonX" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5588260)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/jakdragonx" >JakdragonX</a></span></li> <li>Twitter: @JakdragonX</li> </ol> <p>If you wish to view currently work-in-progress material, you can find his sandbox <a href="http://kontainer.djkakt.us/collab:jakdragonx">here</a>. JakdragonX would also like to recommend the following Foundation personnel to look into in the event that you are &quot;looking for stuff to do.&quot;</p> <ul> <li><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/captain-kirby" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3440103&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609014709" alt="Captain Kirby" s