					<![CDATA[
						 <div style="display: none"></div> <div style="text-align: right;"></div> <div style="text-align: center;"><img src="http://www.scp-wiki.net/local--files/the-graveyard/memoriabanner.jpg" alt="memoriabanner.jpg" class="image" /><br /> <span style="font-family: 'Nanum Brush Script', cursive; color: #390000;font-size: 450%;">In Memoria, Malyce</span></div> <div class="type1"> <p><sup>1</sup>And it came to pass in those days that there was a great lamentation, for Malyce Graves had died.<br /> <sup>2</sup>Lo, even after death, the frantic scribblings continued unabated, and word after word spilled forth from the gaping maw of that unholy sepulcher. Scribbles like many had yet seen, though few believed.<br /> <sup>3</sup> For, in their heart of hearts, the readers knew that these words were the ravings of a broken, yet cunningly demented mind.<br /></p> <div style="text-align: right;"> <p><span style="font-family:var(--body-font); font-size: calc(var(--base-font-size) * 1.00); color: #000000;">- <em>The Unquiet Grave</em>, An autobiography</span></p> </div> </div> <p>Hi! I'm Malyce and I write stuff.</p> <p>You can most often find me in the <a href="http://scpwiki.com/chat-guide">SCP IRC</a> as MalyceGraves, or you can follow me on Twitter <a href="https://twitter.com/MalyceG">@MalyceG</a>.</p> <p>Do enjoy!</p> <hr /> <div class="addenda-header"> <h3><span><span style="font-family: 'Nanum Brush Script', cursive; color: #390000; font-size: 150%"><strong>A Insania in Auditorio</strong></span></span></h3> </div> <br /> <div id="wiki-tabview-2e86aec4b49c441028e6b3912ce710f1" class="yui-navset"> <ul class="yui-nav"> <li class="selected"><a href="javascript:;"><em>Raving</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>In Memoria</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>Commendatur lectio</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>Verbum est Perpetua</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>Ars ab aliis</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>Lectio instrumentum ad</em></a></li> </ul> <div class="yui-content"> <div id="wiki-tab-0-0"> <h4><span><span style="font-family: 'Nanum Brush Script', cursive; color: #390000; font-size: 150%">Tales -</span></span></h4> <table style="width: 100%; border-spacing: 0; border-collapse: collapse;"> <tr> <td style="text-align: left; width: 100%;"><span style="font-family: 'Nanum Brush Script', cursive; color: #390000; font-size: 150%"><strong>I &lt;3 the Circus</strong></span></td> </tr> <tr> <td style="text-align: Left; width: 40%;"> <ul> <li><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/a-night-at-the-circus">Pt.1 - A Night at the Circus</a> - Wherein our Protagonist finds themselves at the Circus</li> <li><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/amongst-the-clowns">Pt.2 - Amongst the Clowns</a> - Wherein our Protagonist is captured by Clowns</li> <li><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/i-heart-the-circus-3">Pt. &lt;3 - Wherever You Go, I'll Follow</a> - Wherein our Protagonist falls in love</li> <li><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/i-heart-the-circus-4">Pt. 4 - For Fear of Falling</a> - Wherein our Protagonist learns to fly</li> </ul> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style="text-align: left; width: 100%;"><span style="font-family: 'Nanum Brush Script', cursive; color: #390000; font-size: 150%"><strong>Other Tales</strong></span></td> </tr> <tr> <td style="text-align: left; width: 1000%;"> <ul> <li><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/the-machine">The Sisyphean Machine</a> - Wherein our Protagonist is forever lost</li> <li><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/anthropological-report-darkwater">Case Study 03: The Darkwater Lodge</a> - Wherein our Protagonist learns about a Neo-Sarkic cult</li> <li><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/midnight-neon">Midnight in the Neon City</a> - Wherein our Protagonist gets mugged</li> <li><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/swamplight">s w a m p l i g h t</a> - Wherein our Protagonist isn't who we think he is ||</li> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/lovataar-throne">Of Lovataar &amp; the Throne</a> - Wherein our Protagonist suffers for love</li> <li><a href="http://scpwiki.com/kelipat">Kelipat Nogah</a> - Wherein our Protagonist issues a call to action</li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/patience">Patience</a> - Wherein our Protagonist laments their lack of understanding.</li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/unbearable-hope">Unbearable Hope</a> - Wherein our Protagonist endures the price of hope</li> </ul> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style="text-align: left; width: 100%;"><span style="font-family: 'Nanum Brush Script', cursive; color: #390000; font-size: 150%"><strong>Written Elsewhere</strong></span></td> </tr> <tr> <td style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; text-align: left; width: 1000%;"> <ul> <li><a href="http://wanderers-library.wikidot.com/homeland">Homeland</a> - Found in the <a href="http://wanderers-library.wikidot.com/">Wanderer's Library</a></li> </ul> </td> </tr> </table> <h4><span><span style="font-family: 'Nanum Brush Script', cursive; color: #390000; font-size: 150%">Set Pieces -</span></span></h4> <table style="width: 100%; border-spacing: 0; border-collapse: collapse;"> <tr> <td style="text-align: left; width: 100%;"><span style="font-family: 'Nanum Brush Script', cursive; color: #390000; font-size: 150%"><strong>SCPF Documentation</strong></span></td> </tr> <tr> <td style="text-align: left; width: 40%;"> <ul> <li><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-4459">SCP-4459: The Ringmaster's Crown</a> - Where we learn of love that lasts</li> <li><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-4476">SCP-4476: La Famille Natau</a> - Where we learn about a family in a swamp</li> <li><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-4421">SCP-4421: Papa Legba's Walkin' Stick</a> - Where we learn of an Old God and His walkin' stick</li> <li><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-5501">SCP-5501: Empty Portraits</a> - Where we learn about madness, cameras, and war</li> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-3862">SCP-3862: The Gentleman Karcist</a> - Where we learn about the love of a Karcist</li> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-3385">SCP-3385: The Last Voyage of the Far Horizon</a> - Where we find out about the death of hope</li> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-3911">SCP-3911: The Thorn of God</a> - Where we learn that some gods should stay dead</li> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-4786">SCP-4786: The Mouth that Hungers</a> - Where we learn about Sarkic flesh dolls</li> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-2834">SCP-2834: The Blood of MEKHANE</a> - Where we see the price of hubris</li> </ul> </td> </tr> <tr> <td style="text-align: left; width: 100%;"><span style="font-family: 'Nanum Brush Script', cursive; color: #390000; font-size: 150%"><strong>GoI Formats</strong></span></td> </tr> <tr> <td style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; text-align: left; width: 100%;"> <ul> <li><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/the-penitent-man">HF Presents: The Penitent Man</a> - Where we learn about one of the Performers at the Circus of the Disquieting</li> <li><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/nancy-shoe">LaRue Post - Nancy's Shoe</a> - Where we find out why Nancy's not a salesman</li> <li><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/larue-post-bang">LaRue Post - BANG!</a> - Where we find Scratch trying to sell a &quot;firework&quot;</li> </ul> </td> </tr> </table> <h4><span><span style="font-family: 'Nanum Brush Script', cursive; color: #390000; font-size: 150%">Collaborations -</span></span></h4> <table style="width: 100%; border-spacing: 0; border-collapse: collapse;"> <tr> <td style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; text-align: left; width: 50%;"> <p>With <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/plaidypus" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4187161&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609014710" alt="plaidypus" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4187161)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/plaidypus" >plaidypus</a></span>:</p> <ul> <li><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-5335">SCP-5335: The Freudian Split</a></li> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-5038">SCP-5038: La Rue Macabre is CLOSED</a></li> </ul> <p>With <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drakimoto" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5255688&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609014710" alt="DrAkimoto" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5255688)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drakimoto" >DrAkimoto</a></span>:</p> <ul> <li><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/ulysses-b-donkman-and-the-clockwork-bandits">Donkman &amp; The Clockwork Bandits</a></li> <li><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/ulysses-b-donkman-and-the-mournful-birthday">Donkman &amp; The Mournful Birthday</a></li> <li><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/ulysses-b-donkman-and-the-foreboding-forest">Donkman &amp; The Foreboding Forest, Pt.1</a></li> <li><a href="http://scpwiki.com/ulysses-b-donkman-and-the-foreboding-forest2">Donkman &amp; The Foreboding Forest, Pt. 2</a></li> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki.net/scp-5108">SCP-5108: We See You</a></li> <li><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-5207">SCP-5207: Fit for the King</a></li> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-4639">SCP-4639: Product Profile - Citrus Vitae</a></li> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/manufactured-nostalgia">Manufactured Nostalgia</a></li> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-5506">SCP-5506: The Best Part Of Waking Up Is Manifesting a New God</a><sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-563469-1" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >1</a></sup></li> </ul> <p>With <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/cybersqyd" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5336470&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609014710" alt="cybersqyd" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5336470)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/cybersqyd" >cybersqyd</a></span>:</p> <ul> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-5862">SCP-5862: Faulkner's Wake</a></li> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/regarding-scp-5862">SCP-5862 Historical Documentation</a></li> </ul> </td> <td style="border-bottom: 1px solid #000; text-align: left; width: 50%;"> <p>With <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dyslexion" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5549954&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609014710" alt="Dyslexion" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5549954)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dyslexion" >Dyslexion</a></span>:</p> <ul> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-5573">SCP-5573: The Eyes of Heaven</a></li> </ul> <p>With <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drhawkwind" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=993076&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609014710" alt="DrHawkwind" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=993076)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/drhawkwind" >DrHawkwind</a></span>:</p> <ul> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-4764">SCP-4764: OKKULT X-PERIENCE OF WYRLDENDING PORPORTIONS</a> - (corpsecon entry)</li> </ul> <p>With <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/n-aepic-fael" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4463776&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609014710" alt="N_Aepic_Fael" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4463776)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/n-aepic-fael" >N_Aepic_Fael</a></span>:</p> <ul> <li><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/et-ecce">Et Ecce Equus Pallidus</a> -</li> </ul> <p>With <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mew-ltiverse" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5271378&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609014710" alt="Mew-ltiverse" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5271378)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mew-ltiverse" >Mew-ltiverse</a></span>:</p> <ul> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-5071">SCP-5071: Exquisite Corpses</a> -</li> </ul> <p>With <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/twistedfox" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6797425&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609014710" alt="TwistedFox" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6797425)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/twistedfox" >TwistedFox</a></span>:</p> <ul> <li><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/i-heart-the-circus-4">Pt. 4 - For Fear of Falling</a></li> </ul> </td> </tr> </table> <h4><span><span style="font-family: 'Nanum Brush Script', cursive; color: #390000; font-size: 150%">Hubs, Guides, and Essays -</span><sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-563469-2" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >2</a></sup></span></h4> <table style="width: 100%; border-spacing: 0; border-collapse: collapse;"> <tr> <td style="text-align: left; width: 100%;"><span style="font-family: 'Nanum Brush Script', cursive; color: #390000; font-size: 150%"><strong>Hubs</strong></span></td> </tr> <tr> <td style="text-align: left; width: 100%;"> <ul> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/memoria-adytum">In Memoria, Adytum</a> - Grand Karcist Ion always knew he had to fall.</li> <li><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/larue-hub">La Rue Macabre Hub</a> - Down in the swamp, anything can happen</li> <li><a href="http://scp-wiki.net/the-donkman-s-den">The Donkman's Den</a> - Some stories just seem unreal even before they're told</li> <li><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/guide-hub">Guide Hub</a> 